14:["$","section","Why a verified sending domain matters",{"className":"guideArticleSection","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Why a verified sending domain matters"}],[["$","p","A campaign platform should use a sending identity controlled by your company. Depending on the provider, you may need to verify DNS records for SPF, DKIM and DMARC alignment. These help receiving systems authenticate email, but they do not guarantee delivery or inbox placement.",{"children":"A campaign platform should use a sending identity controlled by your company. Depending on the provider, you may need to verify DNS records for SPF, DKIM and DMARC alignment. These help receiving systems authenticate email, but they do not guarantee delivery or inbox placement."}],["$","p","Keep normal person-to-person mailbox conversations separate from high-volume campaign sending. Using a Gmail or Microsoft inbox connection does not mean it is the right infrastructure for bulk marketing.",{"children":"Keep normal person-to-person mailbox conversations separate from high-volume campaign sending. Using a Gmail or Microsoft inbox connection does not mean it is the right infrastructure for bulk marketing."}]],"$undefined",false]}]
15:["$","section","How to prepare a useful campaign",{"className":"guideArticleSection","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"How to prepare a useful campaign"}],[["$","p","Write a clear subject line that matches the actual email. Preview the email on mobile, verify all links and personalization, and make the sender easy to recognize. Test the campaign with internal addresses before scheduling a larger send.",{"children":"Write a clear subject line that matches the actual email. Preview the email on mobile, verify all links and personalization, and make the sender easy to recognize. Test the campaign with internal addresses before scheduling a larger send."}]],["$","ul",null,{"className":"guideChecklist","children":[["$","li","Use a narrow segment with a concrete reason to hear from you.",{"children":[["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":18,"height":18,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle-check","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","circle","1mglay",{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"}],["$","path","dzmm74",{"d":"m9 12 2 2 4-4"}],"$undefined"]}],"Use a narrow segment with a concrete reason to hear from you."]}],["$","li","Explain one primary action instead of stacking many competing calls to action.",{"children":[["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":18,"height":18,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle-check","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","circle","1mglay",{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"}],["$","path","dzmm74",{"d":"m9 12 2 2 4-4"}],"$undefined"]}],"Explain one primary action instead of stacking many competing calls to action."]}],["$","li","Include a working unsubscribe process for marketing messages.",{"children":[["$","svg",null,{"ref":